00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:23,090
- Um, can I come back in?     - Why?

245
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:30,150
Well, I was just thinking about how much more we have to talk about.

246
00:16:30,690 --> 00:16:33,030
But you left.

247
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,830
Wow, that didn't take long.

248
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:43,000
I thought you said Tulsa was like a three-hour flight?

249
00:16:44,460 --> 00:16:48,170
Well, you're forgetting about the time difference.

250
00:16:56,340 --> 00:16:57,840
Yeah.

251
00:16:59,850 --> 00:17:00,890
Chandler, you're home.

252
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:05,520
That's right. Your husband's home. So now the sex can stop.

253
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:11,980
What are you saying?

254
00:17:12,190 --> 00:17:14,030
Joey said you're in here with another man.

255
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:17,990
There's no man in here. How dare you accuse me of that.

256
00:17:20,370 --> 00:17:21,410
All right. All right.

257
00:17:21,580 --> 00:17:26,160
Then maybe you won't mind if me and my friend take a look around, huh?

258
00:17:29,500 --> 00:17:30,540
What's he doing?

259
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:33,050
I arranged some pillows on the bed to look like a guy.

260
00:17:36,050 --> 00:17:40,300
Bedroom's clear. Although you might need some new pillows.

261
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:44,100
All right, well, I'll check the guest room.

262
00:17:51,770 --> 00:17:53,980
Why do I smell men's cologne?

263
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:58,360
I think that's you.

264
00:18:00,870 --> 00:18:04,540
Oh, yeah. I rubbed a magazine on myself earlier.

265
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,750
There's nobody here, Joe.

266
00:18:08,540 --> 00:18:09,580
I guess not.

267
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:14,380
I can't believe you thought I was cheating. You owe me an apology.

268
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:17,510
- You're right, Monica. I'm so sorry.     - It's an honest mistake.

269
00:18:17,670 --> 00:18:19,800
It could happen to anybody. All right, see you.

270
00:18:19,970 --> 00:18:22,390
Wait a minute, wait a minute.

271
00:18:22,550 --> 00:18:26,720
If you just got back from Tulsa, how did your suitcase beat you here?

272
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:33,770
I climbed down the fire escape, and you can't put that in the closet?

273
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:40,660
So with the exception of the fermentation process...

274
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:44,240
beer and ale are basically the same thing.

275
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:47,450
Fascinating, isn't it?

276
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:51,460
Maybe you should look up "fascinating."

277
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,670
I'll get it.

278
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:03,760
Hello? Ross' place. Mike speaking.

279
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:07,060
It's for you.

280
00:19:11,060 --> 00:19:14,310
I don't understand what just happened here.

281
00:19:16,690 --> 00:19:18,400
What's going on?

282
00:19:18,570 --> 00:19:19,690
I'm sorry.

283
00:19:19,860 --> 00:19:23,990
I told you I was in Tulsa because I wanted to spend the night with Monica...

284
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:27,990
and I didn't know... I didn't think you'd understand.

285
00:19:28,290 --> 00:19:32,870
You think I'm too dumb to understand a husband needs to be with his wife? Huh?

286
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:36,170
You think I'm, like, duh.

287
00:19:38,590 --> 00:19:41,300
- Joey?     - Yeah.

288
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,840
I don't know what to say. We shouldn't have lied to you.

289
00:19:45,010 --> 00:19:48,310
Yeah, I feel so bad. Is there anything I can do to make it up to you?

290
00:19:50,770 --> 00:19:54,150
Yeah, you could go to the game with me. Even though you said you couldn't.

291
00:19:54,310 --> 00:19:58,770
But then you lied to me and tricked me and gave me a bump on the head.

292
00:19:59,030 --> 00:20:02,860
I'm sorry, that's the one thing I can't do. I promised I'd be with Monica.

293
00:20:03,490 --> 00:20:04,780
All right.

294
00:20:05,530 --> 00:20:07,330
- You can go.     - What?

295
00:20:07,490 --> 00:20:10,330
You should go to the game. It's okay. I want you to.

296
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:13,460
- Really? You gonna be okay?     - Yeah, I'll be fine.

297
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:17,460
You know, maybe I'll stay here and practice the art of seduction.

298
00:20:17,710 --> 00:20:22,260
- You're gonna put sweats on and clean.     - It's gonna be so hot.

299
00:20:22,670 --> 00:20:23,880
- Bye.     - Bye.

300
00:20:24,050 --> 00:20:25,220
Thanks.

301
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:27,550
Here's your ticket.

302
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:29,930
Thanks. Hey, listen...

303
00:20:30,100 --> 00:20:32,730
I'm never gonna lie to you again, okay?

304
00:20:32,940 --> 00:20:36,190
And I want you to know that nobody thinks you're stupid.

305
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:38,060
Thanks, man.

306
00:20:41,360 --> 00:20:44,700
- Where you going?     - Game's tomorrow night, Joe.

307
00:20:49,530 --> 00:20:51,330
- Hi.     - Hi.

308
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:54,330
Oh, God. So glad you're back.

309
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:58,710
So, what did you guys do?

310
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:01,710
Oh, you know, we just drank some beer.

311
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:04,590
Mike played with the boundaries of normal social conduct.

312
00:21:06,010 --> 00:21:08,680
It's true, I did.

313
00:21:09,550 --> 00:21:10,600
- Well, goodbye.     - Okay.

314
00:21:10,810 --> 00:21:13,390
- Bye. That was fun, Pheabs.     - I know. It was fun.

315
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:15,350
See you, guys.

316
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:17,730
Rachel, lock the door. Lock the door, seriously.

317
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:22,070
Oh, shoot, I forgot to pay Phoebe for the drinks.

318
00:21:24,110 --> 00:21:27,490
Wait, wait. Wait, sorry. Did he call? Did that guy call?

319
00:21:27,660 --> 00:21:29,160
No, just his mom.

320
00:21:29,370 --> 00:21:30,570
Oh. Around 8:30?

321
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:32,370
- Yeah.     - Then again at 9:00?

322
00:21:32,580 --> 00:21:34,790
- Uh-huh.     - Yeah.

323
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:42,000
Hello?

324
00:21:42,670 --> 00:21:46,010
Uh, no, she's not here right now. Can I take a message?

325
00:21:46,840 --> 00:21:49,430
Bill from the bar?

326
00:21:51,010 --> 00:21:56,020
Okay, Bill from the bar, I'll make sure she gets your number.

327
00:22:04,230 --> 00:22:05,780
Ah.

328
00:22:07,570 --> 00:22:09,910
So, uh... So how was it?

329
00:22:10,070 --> 00:22:12,200
Did you guys...? You guys have a good time?

330
00:22:12,370 --> 00:22:16,870
We had so much fun. It felt so good to be out.

331
00:22:19,670 --> 00:22:21,290
Uh, Rach?

332
00:22:21,460 --> 00:22:23,210
Yeah?

333
00:22:26,340 --> 00:22:27,510
Never mind.

334
00:22:35,850 --> 00:22:36,890
- Hey, you guys.     - Hey.

335
00:22:37,060 --> 00:22:38,480
Hey.

336
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:42,190
I'll be right back. I gotta go to the bathroom.

337
00:22:56,790 --> 00:22:59,160
Stout. That's a kind of beer.

